     <p title=3D""><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">close</span></p></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">type - enum</p>
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">
      <li data-uuid=3D"d5351bac-2672-4bae-bde9-f8c082dfcf83">deactivate</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e0db4446-ed0d-47a8-b92b-73efa3003901">unload</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dd92cf52-77b4-40f6-a153-677e6b17f945">killReload</li=
>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7de991ad-1eae-470e-a8f3-040a02c610f6">killReactivate=
</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;" title=3D"">None</span></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;" title=3D"">None</span></td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" style=3D"text-align: cente=
r;" data-highlight-colour=3D"#e3fcef">8.0.0</td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" style=3D"text-align: cente=
r;" data-highlight-colour=3D"#e3fcef">:tick:</td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" style=3D"text-align: cente=
r;" data-highlight-colour=3D"#e3fcef">:cross:</td>
    <td class=3D"highlight-#e3fcef confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D"#=
e3fcef">
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">Request the platform to deac=
tivate the app, and possibly take further action</p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">type</p>
     <ul style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">
      <li data-uuid=3D"290b494f-2d02-42d3-869e-359e56e482a3">deactivate - a=
pp is deactivated (if active) - typically a user closing an app</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8f12f05b-57d9-4abc-96e8-4e7dd2f87ac6">unload - app i=
s deactivated (if active) and terminated - typically an app has detected an=
 error</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ad7203a6-5768-4ca1-b242-7072827f3d94">killReload - a=
pp is killed, then reloaded to paused or suspended (by policy)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"780c7d58-291a-434e-a852-02b54ba0b29d">killReactivate=
 - app is killed, reloaded, then activated</li>
     </ul>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">window.close() maps to unloa=
d</p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">window.minimize() maps to de=
activate</p>
     <p>Module is named Lifecycle in C++ Client Library</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"numberingColumn confluenceTd" contenteditable=3D"false" da=
ta-mce-resize=3D"false">23</td>
