e3fcef">
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D""><span style=3D"color:#172b4d=
;">Subscribe to/unsubscribe from lifecycle state changes.&nbsp; The app/run=
time remains in the initializing state until the subscribe call is made to =
the platform</span></p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">Notification of lifecycle st=
ate change, raised after the platform has transitioned the app/runtime to t=
he new lifecycle state</p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">Note: the list always carrie=
s exactly one lifecycle state change</p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">Valid transitions</p>
     <ol style=3D"text-align: left;" title=3D"">
      <li data-uuid=3D"f74f2b93-a0fb-4a60-b3d7-3e1e1075e98c">initializing t=
o&nbsp;paused</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"64e4eefd-b31a-41af-9bc5-413ba3a577bf">initializing t=
o&nbsp;suspended</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"77cdfedb-f430-434b-86b4-c1f7fca06776">paused to&nbsp=
;active</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"76a706d5-988e-400a-920c-d76191c5cfa6">active to paus=
ed</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"db0e19a0-bee9-4201-af11-d1cadf9c950f">paused to&nbsp=
;suspended</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"4cf2e192-3596-4993-9b6e-3f1a0a662fff">suspended to p=
aused</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"32e03b96-028b-4246-adc9-d4dff75fad1c">suspended to&n=
bsp;hibernated</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b50a098a-f890-4a15-9783-fd472077509c">hibernated to =
suspended</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e9415404-778d-4dce-a190-9459cde80998">any to termina=
ting</li>
     </ol></td>
   </tr>
